{"id":"sh/l4r2dc36","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":48,"top":164,"width":553,"height":37},"text":"A learner-authored result","style":{"fontSize":26,"typeface":"Avenir Next","color":"#D7FC70","bold":true,"alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/y1gj2hkf","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":48,"top":209,"width":553,"height":119},"text":"The student writes an observation, an explanation and remaining uncertainty. A completed investigation produces a record someone else can inspect and question.","style":{"fontSize":24,"typeface":"Avenir Next","color":"#F5F6F5","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/z29kbml0","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":48,"top":355,"width":553,"height":37},"text":"The exact observations remain attached","style":{"fontSize":26,"typeface":"Avenir Next","color":"#D7FC70","bold":true,"alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/g7e1sn21","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":48,"top":400,"width":553,"height":145},"text":"The export retains frame IDs, dates, wavelengths, quality results, display settings and archive URLs. File fingerprints and processing details trace the images to their inputs.","style":{"fontSize":24,"typeface":"Avenir Next","color":"#F5F6F5","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/18ni1s3m","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":48,"top":563,"width":553,"height":77},"text":"Existing viewers already compare images. Perigee connects that activity to a short investigation and a portable record of the learner’s reasoning.","style":{"fontSize":21,"typeface":"Avenir Next","color":"#AFB6BA","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/j2d47q54","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":671,"top":151,"width":561,"height":26},"text":"COMPLETED EVIDENCE CARD","style":{"fontSize":17,"typeface":"Avenir Next","color":"#D7FC70","bold":true,"alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
